Or from your IDE:

-   **F5** — build + run with debugger

-   **Ctrl+F5** — build + run without debugger

-   **Ctrl+Shift+B** — build only


```
dotnet run --project app-flyleaf                # Debug
dotnet run --project app-flyleaf -c Release     # Release
```





```
dotnet build app-flyleaf/VideoPlayer.csproj
```



# Update yt-dlp

```
& "D:\Projects\Apps\nullcast\app-flyleaf\bin\Debug\net8.0-windows\yt-dlp.exe" -U
```


```
& "D:\Projects\Apps\nullcast\app-flyleaf\bin\Release\net8.0-windows\yt-dlp.exe" -U
```

